{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00003",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.71,
      "end_seconds": 7.94,
      "duration_seconds": 7.23,
      "text": "Okay, so hi doctor, sorry, the lift was out and I had to take the stairs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.66,
      "end_seconds": 13.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "Yes, come in, take a seat. What can I do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 16.72,
      "end_seconds": 19.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "It's, It's more breathlessness than usual, mostly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.43,
      "end_seconds": 26.46,
      "duration_seconds": 6.03,
      "text": "Is this recent, or has it been a while? These questions might sound routine, but they matter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.72,
      "end_seconds": 30.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "It's been going on for two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.87,
      "end_seconds": 40.46,
      "duration_seconds": 9.59,
      "text": "Okay. Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps. Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.86,
      "end_seconds": 54.88,
      "duration_seconds": 14.02,
      "text": "Yes, stairs and walking. That makes it worse. Pretty severe, if I'm being honest. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it. Oh, and a rattling chest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.95,
      "end_seconds": 58.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "Right, any fever or confusion at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.65,
      "end_seconds": 63.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "So, you know, no. None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.21,
      "end_seconds": 69.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "Have you had any coughing up blood, chest pain or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.1,
      "end_seconds": 73.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "No. None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.78,
      "end_seconds": 77.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.43,
      "end_seconds": 80.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "No, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.09,
      "end_seconds": 84.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Any long-term health problems I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.13,
      "end_seconds": 93.76,
      "duration_seconds": 8.63,
      "text": "Um, I have high blood pressure, for two years. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.98,
      "end_seconds": 95.68,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.04,
      "end_seconds": 104.15,
      "duration_seconds": 8.11,
      "text": "I have COPD, for nearly five years. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.81,
      "end_seconds": 113.49,
      "duration_seconds": 8.68,
      "text": "Okay, I'm following. Right, so that's your known high blood pressure. We'll keep that in mind today. Anyone in the family with similar problems or other conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.76,
      "end_seconds": 116.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "My mother has migraines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.13,
      "end_seconds": 120.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Did you manage to eat before coming?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.68,
      "end_seconds": 124.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Well, yes, I had something small this morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.41,
      "end_seconds": 127.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "What medicines do you take regularly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.6,
      "end_seconds": 142.1,
      "duration_seconds": 11.5,
      "text": "Losartan. I take it 50 milligrams, once a day. So, um, it's Tiotropium inhaler, once a day. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.2,
      "end_seconds": 145.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "Any operations in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.35,
      "end_seconds": 149.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.57,
      "text": "Okay, so just my tonsils out, when I was a child."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.62,
      "end_seconds": 153.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.43,
      "end_seconds": 158.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Oh, no, nothing I'm aware of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.73,
      "end_seconds": 161.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "And alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.43,
      "end_seconds": 166.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "A beer or two most evenings, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.62,
      "end_seconds": 170.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "Let's get your blood pressure and the other basics."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.65,
      "end_seconds": 183.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "Hold still for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.15,
      "end_seconds": 201.5,
      "duration_seconds": 8.35,
      "text": "Okay: pulse is 99 beats a minute, saturation 92 percent, temperature is 37.0 degrees, respiratory rate 24, blood pressure 125 over 88."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 203.04,
      "end_seconds": 205.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.97,
      "end_seconds": 210.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.71,
      "text": "We'll put it in context in a moment. How's everything else at home otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 214.26,
      "end_seconds": 221.35,
      "duration_seconds": 7.09,
      "text": "Busy. Everyone's running in different directions at the moment, you know, you know how it is."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.18,
      "end_seconds": 227.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "I'll examine you now, so please bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.96,
      "end_seconds": 230.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "Let me check your reflexes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.57,
      "end_seconds": 243.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "Air entry is reduced on both sides with a prolonged breathing out phase."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.08,
      "end_seconds": 259.95,
      "duration_seconds": 12.87,
      "text": "That's fine, you can get dressed. Good, that's all I need to examine. Let me gather my thoughts and then we'll talk it through together. Is there anyone at home who can help you out if you need it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 260.3,
      "end_seconds": 270.98,
      "duration_seconds": 10.68,
      "text": "Yes, there's family around most evenings, and they've been very good about checking in, although they do worry more than they need to."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.55,
      "end_seconds": 280.46,
      "duration_seconds": 7.91,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. This looks most like a flare-up of COPD. Heart failure is also on my list."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 280.81,
      "end_seconds": 285.93,
      "duration_seconds": 5.12,
      "text": "Yeah, I've been thinking the worst, to be honest. Is it bad?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.75,
      "end_seconds": 302.08,
      "duration_seconds": 15.33,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now a flare-up of COPD is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had more breathlessness than usual for two weeks, severe, and no weight loss or confusion."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 302.91,
      "end_seconds": 305.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Hmm, yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.79,
      "end_seconds": 315.87,
      "duration_seconds": 9.08,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange a sputum culture for productive cough. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 316.62,
      "end_seconds": 317.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.06,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 318.89,
      "end_seconds": 327.12,
      "duration_seconds": 8.23,
      "text": "I'm going to order blood tests, for infective exacerbation. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 327.84,
      "end_seconds": 329.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "Okay, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 329.56,
      "end_seconds": 339.12,
      "duration_seconds": 9.56,
      "text": "I'll start you on prednisolone, 30 milligrams, once a day, for five days. You take it by mouth. That should help with COPD flare-up."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 340.61,
      "end_seconds": 342.29,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Right, I'll remember that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 343.09,
      "end_seconds": 357.11,
      "duration_seconds": 14.02,
      "text": "Try to get to bed and wake up at the same time each day, and keep your phone away from the bed. Please don't sit on it if you become more breathless or your lips turn blue. That's the point to get seen urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 358.42,
      "end_seconds": 359.12,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Understood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 360.38,
      "end_seconds": 362.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "Let's review you in one week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 363.61,
      "end_seconds": 364.31,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 365.86,
      "end_seconds": 370.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "Just to confirm, what are the next steps as you understand them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 371.09,
      "end_seconds": 379.56,
      "duration_seconds": 8.47,
      "text": "So, I take the prednisolone, 30 milligrams, once a day and come back in one week. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 380.99,
      "end_seconds": 386.38,
      "duration_seconds": 5.39,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Good. Call the clinic if you need us in the meantime."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 387.48,
      "end_seconds": 389.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "No questions. Thank you."
    }
  ]
}